# Ensure this bundle is started (ACTIVE), not merely resolved, once installed into MAT.
#
# Nothing in MAT references com.servoy.mat.mcp, so without this the bundle stays in RESOLVED
# state and SCR never processes its immediate DS component (the MCP HTTP server would never
# start). This p2 touchpoint instruction makes p2 mark the bundle as auto-start, equivalent to
# flipping the bundles.info flag from 'false' to 'true'.
instructions.configure=\
  markStarted(started: true);
